} only. I'll omit labels.\n\ncomponents: include two minimal entries.\n\ncharacteristics.type_level:\n```json\n{\n  \"measuring_principle\": {\"value\": \"water meter - inductive (electromagnetic)\"},\n  \"accuracy_class\": {\"value\": 2},\n  \"q2_over_q1\": {\"value\": 1.6},\n  \"q4_over_q3\": {\"value\": 1.25},\n  \"mpe_lower_flowrate_zone\": {\"value\": {\"min\": -5, \"max\": 5}, \"unit_symbol\": \"%\"},\n  \"temperature_class\": {\"value\": \"T30, T50\"},\n  \"water_pressure_class\": {\"value\": \"MAP16\"},\n  \"pressure_loss_class\": {\"value\": \"Δp16\"},\n  \"reverse_flow\": {\"value\": \"designed to measure\"},\n  \"environmental_class\": {\"value\": \"B\"},\n  \"environmental_class_temperature_range\": {\"value\": {\"min\": 5, \"max\": 55}, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\", \"unit_id\": \"u:degree_Celsius\"},\n  \"electromagnetic_environment\": {\"value\": \"E2\"},\n  \"maximum_admissible_temperature\": {\"value\": 50, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\", \"unit_id\": \"u:degree_Celsius\"},\n  \"maximum_admissible_pressure\": {\"value\": 1.6, \"unit_symbol\": \"MPa\"},\n  \"eut_test_category\": {\"value\": \"B\"},\n  \"eut_test_case\": {\"value\": \"B\"},\n  \"connection_type\": {\"value\": \"Flanges\"},\n  \"minimum_straight_length_inlet_pipe\": {\"value\": 0, \"unit_symbol\": \"mm\"},\n  \"minimum_straight_length_outlet_pipe\": {\"value\": 0, \"unit_symbol\": \"mm\"},\n  \"flow_profile_sensitivity_class\": {\"value\": \"U0D0\"},\n  \"flow_conditioner\": {\"value\": \"No\"},\n  \"mounting\": {\"value\": \"Flanges\"},\n  \"power_supply_type\": {\"value\": \"Battery\"},\n  \"power_supply_voltage_max\": {\"value\": 4.2, \"unit_symbol\": \"V\"},\n  \"power_supply_voltage_min\": {\"value\": 2, \"unit_symbol\": \"V\"},\n  \"minimum_battery_life_time\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit_symbol\": \"years\"},\n  \"software_version\": {\"value\": \"22.28\"},\n  \"crc_checksum\": {\"value\": \"0xCB68D76D\"},\n  \"max_cable_length_remote_version\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"},\n  \"rs485_max_cable_length\": {\"value\": 30, \"unit_symbol\": \"m\"}\n}\n```\n\nmodel_level: q1, q2, q3, q4, length.\n\nconfig_level:\n1. mpe_upper_flowrate_zone / water_temperature\n2. mounting_orientation / q3_over_q1_ratio\n3. indicating_range / display_mode\n4. resolution_of_indicating_device / display_mode\n\nLet me write config values:\n\n```json\n{\"attribute\": \"mpe_upper_flowrate_zone\", \"axis\": \"water_temperature\", \"values\": [\n  {\"condition\": \"water temperature <= 30 °C\", \"value\": {\"min\": -2, \"max\": 2}, \"unit_symbol\": \"%\"},\n  {\"condition\": \"water temperature > 30 °C\", \"value\": {\"min\": -3, \"max\": 3}, \"unit_symbol\": \"%\"}\n]},\n{\"attribute\": \"mounting_orientation\", \"axis\": \"q3_over_q1_ratio\", \"values\": [\n  {\"condition\": \"Q3/Q1 = 250\", \"value\": \"H (horizontal position with the indicating device at the top)\"},\n  {\"condition\": \"Q3/Q1 = 100\", \"value\": \"V (vertical position with flow from bottom to top); H also permitted\"}\n]},\n```\nHmm \"H also permitted\" — is that stated? The Q3/Q1 row: \"R250 for H↑; R100 for V↑\". The orientation limitation row: \"H for R250; V↑ for R100\". It doesn't explicitly say R100 permits H. To not fabricate: value for R100: \"V↑ (vertical position with flow from bottom to top)\". Keep as stated.\n\n```json\n{\"attribute\": \"indicating_range\", \"axis\": \"display_mode_and_nominal_diameter\", \"values\": [\n  {\"condition\": \"normal resolution mode (all models)\", \"value\": 99999999, \"unit_symbol\": \"m³\"},\n  {\"condition\": \"high resolution mode (DN25-DN65 only)\", \"value\": 99999, \"unit_symbol\": \"m³\"}\n]},\n{\"attribute\": \"resolution_of_indicating_device\", \"axis\": \"display_mode_and_nominal_diameter\", \"values\": [\n  {\"condition\": \"normal resolution mode (all models)\", \"value\": 0.001, \"unit_symbol\": \"m³\"},\n  {\"condition\": \"high resolution mode (DN25-DN65 only)\", \"value\": 0.000001, \"unit_symbol\": \"m³\"}\n]}\n```\n\nWait — is indicating ran